  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Development and Commercialisation of a Second Generation Rapid Diagnostic Test (RDT) for Human African Trypanosomiasis (HAT) and other Kinetoplastida</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Research and development activity contributing to the UK&#x2019;s strategy to address key development challenges.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will develop new tests for the detection and diagnosis of sleeping sickness, which threatens 43.4 million people in the sub-Saharan area of Africa, and the development of new, more reliable and economic diagnostic biomarkers and assays for surveillance and to curb transmission.</narrative>
  </description>
